#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/0-index.md:5
#: 96052c13b8354b6d88f6d045d9f8aa11
msgid ""
"`hardware:=mock_components` / `gz` / `isaac` are launch keys, not vendor "
"hardware-interface packages under `hardwares/`. Plugin table: "
"[ros2_control in This Stack](../../3-concepts/1-ros2_control_here.md). "
"Isaac topic `<param>` names: "
"[topic_based_ros2_control](../../4-reference/hardware/1-topic_based.md)."
msgstr ""
"`hardware:=mock_components` / `gz` / `isaac` 是 launch 键，不是 `hardwares/` "
"下的厂商驱动层包。插件表：[本栈中的 "
"ros2_control](../../3-concepts/1-ros2_control_here.md)。Isaac 话题 `<param>`"
" "
"名：[topic_based_ros2_control](../../4-reference/hardware/1-topic_based.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/0-index.md:7
